---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms | West Ridge Rentals" description="Terms of use for the West Ridge Rentals website.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-4 text-wr-text">
    <h1 class="text-5xl">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-wr-muted">Draft placeholder. Have this reviewed before launch.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl pt-4">Requests are not bookings</h2>
    <p>Submitting a rental request does not reserve equipment or create a rental agreement. A rental is confirmed only when West Ridge Rentals confirms it and a rental agreement is signed.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl pt-4">Pricing and availability</h2>
    <p>Equipment, specifications and availability shown on this site are subject to change. Pricing is provided on request and confirmed at booking.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl pt-4">Rental requirements</h2>
    <p>Rentals may require a valid ID, proof of insurance, a deposit and a signed rental agreement.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl pt-4">Use of this site</h2>
    <p>Content on this site is provided for informational purposes and may not be copied or reused without permission.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
